CellProfiler Pipeline: http://www.cellprofiler.org
Version:5

Default Input Folder: .
Default Output Folder: ./_cp_out

Module: LoadData
    ModuleNum: 1
    Enabled: True
    Load from a file: Yes
    File name: Experiment.csv
    Base image location: Default Input Folder
    Set the joining columns: No
    Group images by metadata: No

Module: NamesAndTypes
    ModuleNum: 2
    Enabled: True
    Select the type of images you want to load: Grayscale image
    Name to assign these images: RawBF
    Select the image location: Load images based on this data: LoadData

Module: SaveImages
    ModuleNum: 3
    Enabled: True
    Select the image to save: RawBF
    Select the image file format: tif
    Output file location: Default Output Folder
    Create subfolders in the output folder: No
    File name: saved_image
